#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-flake-show.md:47
msgid ""
"This command shows the output attributes provided by the flake specified by "
"flake reference _flake-url_. These are the top-level attributes in the "
"`outputs` of the flake, as well as lower-level attributes for some standard "
"outputs (e.g. `packages` or `checks`)."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-flake-show.md:52
msgid ""
"With `--json`, the output is in a JSON representation suitable for automatic "
"processing by other tools."
msgstr ""

